sequenceDiagram
  actor O as Operator
  participant A as VMF API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant G as PGW API
  participant P as Proxmox API
  participant V as Guest VM
  O->>A: POST /v1/instances (Idempotency-Key)
  A->>D: reserve VMID/IP/hostname + create job
  A-->>O: 202 Accepted + job_id
  A->>G: create client and suspended mapping
  A->>P: clone template
  P-->>A: task UPID
  A->>P: poll task until stopped
  A->>P: configure NIC/cloud-init/QGA
  A->>G: activate mapping
  A->>P: start VM
  A->>V: wait QGA/cloud-init
  A->>V: identity/network validation
  A->>G: egress proof
  A->>V: apply workload adapter
  A->>D: READY + evidence + audit
